    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u03.d05.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "Requests & offers",
        "ru": "Просьбы и предложения"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "Ask politely with Can/Could you…? and Can I…? Offer with Would you like…? or I'll… Answer: Sure. / Of course. / No problem.",
        "ru": "Вежливая просьба: Can/Could you…? и Can I…? Предложение: Would you like…? или I'll… Ответы: Sure. / Of course. / No problem."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "request",
            "ru": "просьба"
          },
          "formula": "Could you + verb …?",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Could you help me, please?",
              "ru": "Не мог бы ты помочь?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "permission",
            "ru": "разрешение"
          },
          "formula": "Can I + verb …?",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Can I borrow your pen?",
              "ru": "Можно взять твою ручку?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "offer",
            "ru": "предложение"
          },
          "formula": "Would you like …? / I'll …",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Would you like some tea? I'll help you.",
              "ru": "Хотите чаю? Я помогу."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "Could is more polite than can, but both take the bare verb: \"Could you open…\", not \"Could you to open…\".",
          "ru": "Could вежливее can, но оба с голым глаголом: \"Could you open…\", а не \"Could you to open…\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "Offer with I'll (= I will) for a quick decision: \"I'll get it.\"",
          "ru": "Предложение через I'll (= I will) для мгновенного решения: \"I'll get it.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u03.d05.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "A busy morning",
        "ru": "Занятое утро"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u03.d05.reading.b1",
          "en": "It was a busy morning at the office. Nina had a lot of work. 'Could you help me with this report?' she asked Tom. 'Sure, no problem,' he said.",
          "ru": "В офисе было занятое утро. У Нины было много работы. «Не мог бы ты помочь с отчётом?» — спросила она Тома. «Конечно, без проблем», — ответил он.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u03.d05.reading.b1.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u03.d05.reading.b2",
          "en": "Later Tom said, 'Would you like a coffee?' 'Yes, please,' said Nina. 'And can I borrow your charger?' 'Of course. I'll bring it now.'",
          "ru": "Позже Том сказал: «Хочешь кофе?» «Да, пожалуйста», — сказала Нина. «И можно взять твою зарядку?» «Конечно. Сейчас принесу.»",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u03.d05.reading.b2.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
